    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/a_.png?t=1753202520\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/7138318d52cc9deddb510d717d5b2dfa.poster.avif?t=1753202520\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/7138318d52cc9deddb510d717d5b2dfa.webm?t=1753202520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/7138318d52cc9deddb510d717d5b2dfa.mp4?t=1753202520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Operative Revolve is a <strong>cinematic roguelike deckbuilder</strong> with a unique gameplay mechanic. Play as <strong>Operatives</strong>, secret agents who oversee a world governed by machine ideology. Use your <strong>Machine cards</strong> to physically attack or block damage while battling enemies who oppose your directive and uncover the hidden truths within the machinated world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/361d58961f853959d6d0efcd29bdc65f.avif?t=1753202520\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card can be upgraded by installing unique frame and wheel component. Each component boasts its own distinct design and effects - Utilize them to optimize your cards and experiment with different gameplay strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/4ce7af2700cc6dc0b27714bc00352c46.poster.avif?t=1753202520\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/4ce7af2700cc6dc0b27714bc00352c46.webm?t=1753202520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Destructible Cards</strong> - Cards destroyed in battle do not restore themselves until the next battle. They have their own unique health system, indicated by both the number on their wheel and the wheel type, which changes how damage is calculated.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/c3811c02cd32138f66629cec067ab2d9.avif?t=1753202520\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assets\u00a0</strong>- Powerful resources which further improve your component-card combos or create new gameplay strategies.  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/f8b5f63633deddaafb509f80130068b0.avif?t=1753202520\" width=616 height=201 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Intense Combat</strong> - Featuring unique combat mechanics that alters gameplay mechanics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/03c9b3c78db814ae82358d3df894ff33.poster.avif?t=1753202520\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/03c9b3c78db814ae82358d3df894ff33.webm?t=1753202520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/03c9b3c78db814ae82358d3df894ff33.mp4?t=1753202520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain Mechanics</strong> - Explore multiple ways to chain your strategies into powerful combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/843e7d2c6eba7ed5dc0265f358e886fd.poster.avif?t=1753202520\" width=600 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/843e7d2c6eba7ed5dc0265f358e886fd.webm?t=1753202520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/843e7d2c6eba7ed5dc0265f358e886fd.mp4?t=1753202520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/84e0b935d40ffca5043532a20e8ebc7e.poster.avif?t=1753202520\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/84e0b935d40ffca5043532a20e8ebc7e.webm?t=1753202520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/84e0b935d40ffca5043532a20e8ebc7e.mp4?t=1753202520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Challenge</strong> - Enemies come in varied forms and employ dynamic attack strategies. Enemy behaviors can be rolled and remixed each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Replayability</strong> - Each run is different. Select 2 out of 6 Operatives to battle against enemies with evolving behaviors, experiencing a myriad of interactions with the Operatives, world building, and story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Multi-Directional</strong> - Card placement is key to your strategy, enemies will attack from different directions.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Combination Deck</strong> - Each Operative has their own set of unique cards, designed to synergize differently when paired with a different Operative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Optimization</strong> - This game is optimized to run smoothly on older devices. We aim to release with Steam Deck verification. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Deep Lore\u00a0</strong>-\u00a0Command your Operatives in battle while unraveling the deep mystery of the omniscient Machine Doctrine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/b405a397512beeaeaa6e86c030503426.avif?t=1753202520\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/a1e2439a8aa77d3cd9ee460418300d47.avif?t=1753202520\" width=616 height=132 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/a_.png?t=1753202520\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/7138318d52cc9deddb510d717d5b2dfa.poster.avif?t=1753202520\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/7138318d52cc9deddb510d717d5b2dfa.webm?t=1753202520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/7138318d52cc9deddb510d717d5b2dfa.mp4?t=1753202520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Operative Revolve is a <strong>cinematic roguelike deckbuilder</strong> with a unique gameplay mechanic. Play as <strong>Operatives</strong>, secret agents who oversee a world governed by machine ideology. Use your <strong>Machine cards</strong> to physically attack or block damage while battling enemies who oppose your directive and uncover the hidden truths within the machinated world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/361d58961f853959d6d0efcd29bdc65f.avif?t=1753202520\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card can be upgraded by installing unique frame and wheel component. Each component boasts its own distinct design and effects - Utilize them to optimize your cards and experiment with different gameplay strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/4ce7af2700cc6dc0b27714bc00352c46.poster.avif?t=1753202520\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/4ce7af2700cc6dc0b27714bc00352c46.webm?t=1753202520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Destructible Cards</strong> - Cards destroyed in battle do not restore themselves until the next battle. They have their own unique health system, indicated by both the number on their wheel and the wheel type, which changes how damage is calculated.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/c3811c02cd32138f66629cec067ab2d9.avif?t=1753202520\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assets\u00a0</strong>- Powerful resources which further improve your component-card combos or create new gameplay strategies.  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/f8b5f63633deddaafb509f80130068b0.avif?t=1753202520\" width=616 height=201 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Intense Combat</strong> - Featuring unique combat mechanics that alters gameplay mechanics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/03c9b3c78db814ae82358d3df894ff33.poster.avif?t=1753202520\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/03c9b3c78db814ae82358d3df894ff33.webm?t=1753202520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/03c9b3c78db814ae82358d3df894ff33.mp4?t=1753202520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain Mechanics</strong> - Explore multiple ways to chain your strategies into powerful combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/843e7d2c6eba7ed5dc0265f358e886fd.poster.avif?t=1753202520\" width=600 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/843e7d2c6eba7ed5dc0265f358e886fd.webm?t=1753202520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/843e7d2c6eba7ed5dc0265f358e886fd.mp4?t=1753202520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/84e0b935d40ffca5043532a20e8ebc7e.poster.avif?t=1753202520\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/84e0b935d40ffca5043532a20e8ebc7e.webm?t=1753202520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/84e0b935d40ffca5043532a20e8ebc7e.mp4?t=1753202520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Challenge</strong> - Enemies come in varied forms and employ dynamic attack strategies. Enemy behaviors can be rolled and remixed each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Replayability</strong> - Each run is different. Select 2 out of 6 Operatives to battle against enemies with evolving behaviors, experiencing a myriad of interactions with the Operatives, world building, and story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Multi-Directional</strong> - Card placement is key to your strategy, enemies will attack from different directions.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Combination Deck</strong> - Each Operative has their own set of unique cards, designed to synergize differently when paired with a different Operative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Optimization</strong> - This game is optimized to run smoothly on older devices. We aim to release with Steam Deck verification. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Deep Lore\u00a0</strong>-\u00a0Command your Operatives in battle while unraveling the deep mystery of the omniscient Machine Doctrine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/b405a397512beeaeaa6e86c030503426.avif?t=1753202520\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/a1e2439a8aa77d3cd9ee460418300d47.avif?t=1753202520\" width=616 height=132 /></span></p>",
